# The chat-ui image builds from the repository root (so the index stage can read
# knowledge-base/). Keep secrets, infra and scratch out of the build context.
.git
# Secrets anywhere in the tree, not just the root.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/env.sh
.claude/
deploy/
docs/
.superpowers/
.index/
.github/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
scratch.txt
tools/scrape/input/
evals/results/
**/.pytest_cache
